<title>POLAND: BPH SEPT NET SOARS TO PLN 26.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH SEPT NET SOARS TO PLN 26.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 26.32 vs   11.83</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   46.07 vs   20.55</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 69.43 vs   33.97</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	92.65 vs   80.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					218.23 vs  185.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  335.37 vs  278.34</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		502.94 vs  375.82</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     773.41 vs  752.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Przemyslowo-</p>
<p>Handlowy SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
